{"id":"formularios-tipos-de-input-y-atributos","title":"Formularios - Tipos de input y atributos","topic":"html","topicLabel":"HTML","tags":["aprendizaje","html"],"course":null,"headings":[{"depth":2,"text":"¿Qué es?","id":"que-es"},{"depth":2,"text":"¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)","id":"como-se-escribe-sintaxis"}],"readingMins":1,"codeBlocks":1,"words":193,"backlinks":[{"id":"sesion-11-22-05-26","title":"Sesion_11_22.05.26","topicLabel":"JavaScript","session":11}],"html":"<h2 id=\"que-es\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Qué es?</h2><p>La etiqueta <code>&lt;input&gt;</code> es el elemento más flexible de un formulario. Su comportamiento, validación y presentación visual cambian radicalmente según el valor del atributo <code>type</code>. Utilizar el tipo correcto no solo activa la validación nativa del navegador, sino que adapta los teclados virtuales en dispositivos móviles (por ejemplo, mostrando el teclado numérico con <code>type=&quot;number&quot;</code> o la tecla <code>@</code> con <code>type=&quot;email&quot;</code>).</p>\n<h2 id=\"como-se-escribe-sintaxis\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)</h2><div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">html</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- Inputs de texto, seguridad y números --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;usuario&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Usuario:<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;text&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;usuario&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;usuario&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">placeholder</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Ej: friki&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">required</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;clave&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Contraseña:<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;password&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;clave&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;clave&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">minlength</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;8&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">required</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;edad&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Edad:<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;number&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;edad&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;edad&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">min</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;18&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">max</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;99&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- Inputs de Selección (Radio Buttons y Checkboxes) --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- El atributo &#x27;name&#x27; en los radios debe ser idéntico en el grupo para que sea de selección única --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">fieldset</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">legend</span>&gt;</span>Plan de Pago<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">legend</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;radio&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;mensual&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;plan&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">value</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;mensual&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;mensual&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Mensual<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;radio&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;anual&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;plan&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">value</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;anual&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;anual&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Anual<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">fieldset</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">fieldset</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">legend</span>&gt;</span>Intereses<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">legend</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;checkbox&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;css&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;temas&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">value</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;css&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;css&quot;</span>&gt;</span>CSS<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;checkbox&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;js&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;temas&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">value</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;js&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;js&quot;</span>&gt;</span>JavaScript<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">fieldset</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- Controles Especiales --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;cv&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Adjunta tu CV (PDF):<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;file&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;cv&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;cv&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">accept</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;.pdf&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;satisfaccion&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Satisfacción (0-10):<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;range&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;satisfaccion&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;satisfaccion&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">min</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;0&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">max</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;10&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;colorFondo&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Color del perfil:<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;color&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;colorFondo&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;colorFondo&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">value</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;#1f4e79&quot;</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div>"}